<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>At the end of a powerful denial, I found myself alone in this world.<PG>
The result of denying the facts so strongly and trying to escape them―
{PAUSE ""}
this world took shape, and I fled into it.<PG>
This is a world that came into being so that I could escape what I had done and the death of Natsumi.<PG>
But in this world, I learned something. 
{PAUSE ""}
Just how much of a miracle the path I had walked had been.<PG>
In any other ending, an incident occurred on April 8, whatever the year, and it all ended in misery.<PG>
For a while, here in this world, I looked back on that miraculous path.<PG>
I savored how happy a road I had walked right up until I stabbed Natsumi to death, and I was filled, just a little, by that happiness full of empty show.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
But it was only natural that emptiness would come over me before long. 
{PAUSE ""}
Looking back on such things alone is only hollow. 
{PAUSE ""}
That being so, I wanted someone who would watch the happy ending together with me.<PG>
I thought that someone who was not of the world I had lived in, someone with no connection to that world, would surely rejoice in the happy ending with me, purely.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
And the first to arrive was <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
Calling myself a guide, I went back over this miraculous path together with <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama.<PG>
Growing up with my best friend, in time learning that we were sisters, living in fortunate surroundings, I avoid the tragedy and arrive at a happy ending.<PG>
I wanted someone I could share this happiness with. 
{PAUSE ""}
Rather than going back over it hollowly on my own, I wanted someone I could share a happy ending with, like this.<PG>
Purely for that self-satisfaction of mine, I have had <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama keep me company. I am sorry.
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
